  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Teardrop the Rikka Sacred Queen",
      "effect": "2 Level 10 Plant monsters\nYou can also Xyz Summon this card by using \"Teardrop the Rikka Queen\" you control (transfer its materials). (Quick Effect): You can detach up to 6 materials from this card; send that many Spells/Traps from the field to the GY, then you can Tribute 1 monster on either field. You can only use this effect of \"Teardrop the Rikka Sacred Queen\" once per turn. Each time a monster(s) is Tributed: Attach 1 card from your opponent's GY to 1 Plant Xyz Monster you control."
    },
